<InfoPageLayout title="Privacy Policy | Click Jyotish" description="How Click Jyotish collects, uses and protects consultation enquiries and birth details." eyebrow="PRIVACY POLICY">
  <p><strong>Last updated: 11 October 2026</strong></p>
  <p>Click Jyotish, operated by Deepak Maheshwari, respects your privacy. This policy explains how we handle information submitted through clickjyotish.in.</p>
  <h2>Information we collect</h2>
  <p>When you request a consultation, we may collect your name, WhatsApp number, email address, date, time and place of birth, consultation preference, language preference and the question you choose to share.</p>
  <h2>Why we use it</h2>
  <p>We use this information to respond to your enquiry, arrange or deliver a consultation, communicate about a booking, provide customer support, and keep reasonable business records. We do not sell your personal information.</p>
  <h2>Where it is stored</h2>
  <p>Website enquiries are stored in a private Click Jyotish lead inbox hosted through Cloudflare. Access is restricted to authorised business use. If you choose to contact us on WhatsApp, WhatsApp's own terms and privacy practices also apply.</p>
  <h2>Sharing</h2>
  <p>We do not share consultation details for unrelated marketing. Information may be processed by the technical services used to run the website, booking and communication tools, only as needed to provide those services or where required by law.</p>
  <h2>Retention and deletion requests</h2>
  <p>We keep enquiry information only for as long as reasonably needed for consultation, support and record-keeping. To request access, correction or deletion of your information, email <a href="mailto:support@clickjyotish.in">support@clickjyotish.in</a> from the email address used in your enquiry. We may need to verify your identity before acting on a request.</p>
  <h2>Security</h2>
  <p>We use reasonable technical and organisational measures to protect information. No online service can guarantee absolute security, so please avoid sending highly sensitive documents or payment information through an unrequested channel.</p>
  <h2>Changes to this policy</h2>
  <p>We may update this policy when our practices or the website changes. The revised version will be posted here with a new update date.</p>
  <p class="notice">This plain-language policy is provided for transparency and should be reviewed with a qualified legal professional for advice specific to your business.</p>
</InfoPageLayout>
